"The Ghost of Christmas Past appears during the scene, illuminating Fezziwig's celebration and prompting Scrooge's reflection on happiness and generosity."
"The Ghost of Christmas Past is a supernatural figure that shows Scrooge scenes from his earlier life, highlighting his transformation and the consequences of his greed."
